{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/ee483e202f283eccb6def80504860b3e.avif?t=1766880170\" width=450 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bust Buddies</strong> is an absurd co-op party game where you whip out your tools to out-bust your buddies. Take on random or player-made prompts, sculpt cursed marble creations, and battle it out to see who\u2019s not just the best buster... but the true Bust GOD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/0cd0e56d4fa29aad9731a2a470d741d2.poster.avif?t=1766880170\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/0cd0e56d4fa29aad9731a2a470d741d2.webm?t=1766880170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/0cd0e56d4fa29aad9731a2a470d741d2.mp4?t=1766880170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/c00b23b470255bf2f4b967d66679aa6a.avif?t=1766880170\" width=450 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the humble chisel and hammer, just like the Greek Busters.\u00a0Then bust it wide open with chaotic upgrades like chainsaws, intergalactic guns, spray paints, and plenty more cursed tools to ruin fine art history forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/258ebf6af071f13f082eefca02cdefce.poster.avif?t=1766880170\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/258ebf6af071f13f082eefca02cdefce.webm?t=1766880170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/258ebf6af071f13f082eefca02cdefce.mp4?t=1766880170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/d48f04127bdab3c24722081be0e9ba1e.avif?t=1766880170\" width=450 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So many ways to bust it feels illegal.\u00a0Take on random prompts in Classic Mode, force your friends to bust out your cursed ideas, or even help your bro bust in Bust Bros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/48247ed0782caa89aa64bfec1ddd65ad.poster.avif?t=1766880170\" width=800 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/48247ed0782caa89aa64bfec1ddd65ad.webm?t=1766880170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768810/extras/ea78f822c86c6db735d578dccb9404fa.avif?t=1766880170\" wid